{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_PLATFORM_SECTION_1_Std_ReturnType_Rte_Read__p___o_boolean_v","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_RTE","page":390,"text":"1 Std_ReturnType Rte_Read_<p>_<o>(boolean *v) {\n2\n/* fetch the bit field from the RAM Block */\n3\nuint32 bitfield = Rte_RamBlk_<BlkNr>.bitfield;\n4\n/* bit operation (masking & conversion) - bit position 6 is deduced\n5\nfrom\nBITFIELD-TEXTTABLE-MASK-SECOND */\n6\n*v = Bfx_GetBit_u8u8u8(bitfield, 6);\n7\n}\nExample 4.13\nConversion between two DataPrototypes with a CompuMethod of category BIT-\nFIELD_TEXTTABLE (mapping of 32bit bitfield of type uint32 to 4bit bitfield of type\nuint8):\nDefinition of the TextTableMapping in XML:\n<PORT-INTERFACE-MAPPING-SET>\n<SHORT-NAME>PortMappingSet</SHORT-NAME>\n<PORT-INTERFACE-MAPPINGS>\n<VARIABLE-AND-PARAMETER-INTERFACE-MAPPING>\n<SHORT-NAME>Mapping_BF32_BF4</SHORT-NAME>\n<DATA-MAPPINGS>\n<DATA-PROTOTYPE-MAPPING>\n<FIRST-DATA-PROTOTYPE-REF DEST=\"VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE\">\n/Example/Interfaces/One/BF32\n</FIRST-DATA-PROTOTYPE-REF>\n<SECOND-DATA-PROTOTYPE-REF DEST=\"VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE\">\n/Example/Interfaces/Two/BF4\n</SECOND-DATA-PROTOTYPE-REF>\n<TEXT-TABLE-MAPPINGS>\n<TEXT-TABLE-MAPPING>\n<IDENTICAL-MAPPING>true</IDENTICAL-MAPPING>\n<MAPPING-DIRECTION>firstToSecond</MAPPING-DIRECTION>\n<BITFIELD-TEXTTABLE-MASK-FIRST>\n0b00000000000000000000000000001111\n</BITFIELD-TEXTTABLE-MASK-FIRST>\n<BITFIELD-TEXTTABLE-MASK-SECOND>\n0b00001111\n</BITFIELD-TEXTTABLE-MASK-SECOND>\n</TEXT-TABLE-MAPPING>\n</TEXT-TABLE-MAPPINGS>\n</DATA-PROTOTYPE-MAPPING>\n</DATA-MAPPINGS>\n</VARIABLE-AND-PARAMETER-INTERFACE-MAPPING>\n</PORT-INTERFACE-MAPPINGS>\n</PORT-INTERFACE-MAPPING-SET>\nC code for Implementat","caption":"1 Std_ReturnType Rte_Read_<p>_<o>(boolean *v) {","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_PLATFORM_SECTION_1_Std_ReturnType_Rte_Read__p___o_boolean_v","releases":["R24-11"],"page":401,"hash":"154c89b595696236","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_PLATFORM_SECTION_1_Std_ReturnType_Rte_Read__p___o_boolean